  "instructions": [
    "Prepared from actual completed receipts. ONLY historical_model_release_ci, model_release_ci and final_report_ci remain null pending actual terminals. ROOT must review every false flag and bind those actual CI outcomes/whole directories before READY_FOR_BINDING. No CI future success is asserted. Science actual consumer independent review is included explicitly. All source/runtime/consumer/graph assertions below were checked against retained bytes, not replayed.",
    "Final release is actual1f132f20 / Workflow6l8w9 / UIDfd2e81ec. Bind current model_runtime only to actual terminal successor runtime-model-02, retaining failed runtime-model-01 and settle review. Keep both render-after generations, the original rollout refusal and final four-object operation; operation success alone is not runtime acceptance. Bind historical and final release CI receipts by their actual final filenames; no future receipt filename is fabricated.",
    "Bind historical_model_release_ci only to actual terminal12e3/dslbn, preserving its whole model-release-ci directory. Current model_release_source must be the new final release; final model_release_ci and model_rollout must match that revision and cannot reuse12e3/dslbn. Include final CI02 and rollout02 directories; both old refusal and new actual results remain distinct.",
    "Same87whm/UID410/source56 current model_source_ci receipt must combine final recovery terminal with original source-gate02 custody. Do not relabel any failed/historical attempt; all original admission/failure/recovery03/04 paths stay selected. Add actual later checkpoint-publication proof through additional_evidence using its exact supplied path/hash; no future checkpoint success is assumed.",
    "Set status READY_FOR_BINDING only when all real records are bound. Current model_source_ci must be56b316f3/87whm; original18269/99648 remains FAILED and its whole original directory plus terminal evidence remain selected. Do not reuse the failed original as current success.",
    "ROOT fills actual missing terminal/source bindings and reviews fixed entries. Nulls and false review flags refuse; no future status or success is assumed.",
    "For each terminal role: path,sha256,reviewed_by_root,terminal,outcome,terminal_indicator {field:[keys],equals:actual},assertions:[{field:[keys],equals:actual}],attempt_directories_to_include. Source roles need path/hash/review and directories.",
    "Add exact actual model-release and report-CI Workflow metadata bindings. Include every failed/refused original and successor attempt in roles/additional_evidence; preserve complete logs.",
    "Both consumer roles may bind one aggregate actual receipt with respective case assertions. If a case was never started due to first-case failure, bind actual terminal wrapper with outcome incomplete and exact evidence of that limit; never invent a case receipt.",
    "Additional new ROOT source helpers/checks and frozen failures use additional_evidence entries {path,sha256,reviewed_by_root,attempt_directories_to_include}; existing platform/control/science directories stay selected.",
    "This only finalizes custody selection. Existing scanner, byte/member limits, final broader credential scan and publication are separate."
